# Safety rules for frumo: CI, hooks, check scripts, lint/type/test config and agent instructions.
# A change to any of these paths changes what "checked" means, so it needs the owner's explicit OK.
# Enforced on GitHub: agents push as nanocarrica and the main-gate ruleset requires a code-owner review,
# so a pull request changing any path below cannot merge until @MarianoCarrica approves it. All other
# pull requests merge with green checks and no approval.

/.github/            @MarianoCarrica
/.github/CODEOWNERS  @MarianoCarrica
/AGENTS.md           @MarianoCarrica
/CLAUDE.md           @MarianoCarrica
/.husky/             @MarianoCarrica
/.githooks/          @MarianoCarrica
/scripts/check-*     @MarianoCarrica
/eslint.config.js    @MarianoCarrica
/eslint.config.mjs   @MarianoCarrica
/eslint-rules/       @MarianoCarrica
/tsconfig.json       @MarianoCarrica
/vitest.config.ts    @MarianoCarrica
/vitest.config.js    @MarianoCarrica
/test/setup*         @MarianoCarrica
